<title>INDIA: India DCM Shriram Consolidated net rises.</title>
<headline>India DCM Shriram Consolidated net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's DCM Shriram Consolidated Ltd posted a net profit of 488.1 million rupees in 1996/97 (April-March), compared with 417.9 million rupees in the previous year, the Press Trust of India (PTI) said on Friday.</p>
</text>
